      "id": "resolve-sdk-hosting",
      "impact": "additive",
      "summary": "resolveSdkHosting({ assetRoot, helperHost }) resolves a packaged Host's SDK hosting values from the copySdkPackagingAssets directory for process.platform and process.arch: daemon spreads into DaemonConfig and adapters into RuntimeAdaptersConfig. A missing required asset throws the new SdkHostingAssetsMissingError (code sdk_hosting_assets_missing, sorted relative missing paths); an unsupported target throws. sdkPackagingAssetLayout and sdkDistributionManifest keep the same values; only their declaration text changed (the agent-memory-fs directory now has one definition). The four existing configuration fields are unchanged (#1839).",
